    "detailed_description": "Master of Puppets is a turn based strategy game with resource management and a deck building mechanic. Each turn, cards are played to build and upgrade a squad of Mechs. The Mechs can be moved around on the game board to protect strategic locations, gather resources, find treasure and, most importantly, attack enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMaster of Puppets comes with a variety of game modes, including a growing library of handcrafted stories and an infinite number of procedurally generated campaigns. Procedurally generated campaigns has 3 planets of 12, 18 and 24 maps to a total of 54 maps per campaign. As you unlock each location you will be able to collect more cards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Endless number of procedurally generated campaigns.<br />\r\n\u2022 54 maps of increasing difficulty for each campaign.<br />\r\n\u2022 Handcrafted story based campaigns added regularly.<br />\r\n\u2022 86 different cards with more coming.<br />\r\n\u2022 Fuse, forge and upgrade cards to build your custom deck.<br />\r\n\u2022 4 mission types.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet the free demo today, or play the single map preview directly in your browser:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nhttps://play.unity.com/mg/other/mop-8m2km",
    "about_the_game": "Master of Puppets is a turn based strategy game with resource management and a deck building mechanic. Each turn, cards are played to build and upgrade a squad of Mechs. The Mechs can be moved around on the game board to protect strategic locations, gather resources, find treasure and, most importantly, attack enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMaster of Puppets comes with a variety of game modes, including a growing library of handcrafted stories and an infinite number of procedurally generated campaigns. Procedurally generated campaigns has 3 planets of 12, 18 and 24 maps to a total of 54 maps per campaign. As you unlock each location you will be able to collect more cards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Endless number of procedurally generated campaigns.<br />\r\n\u2022 54 maps of increasing difficulty for each campaign.<br />\r\n\u2022 Handcrafted story based campaigns added regularly.<br />\r\n\u2022 86 different cards with more coming.<br />\r\n\u2022 Fuse, forge and upgrade cards to build your custom deck.<br />\r\n\u2022 4 mission types.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet the free demo today, or play the single map preview directly in your browser:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nhttps://play.unity.com/mg/other/mop-8m2km",
